olor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="chip" href="#services" data-route="services"><svg class="c-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"/><path d="M12 7v13M5 13a7 7 0 0014 0M5 13H3M19 13h2M8 11h8"/></svg><span class="c-name">Fiberglass</span><svg class="c-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section style="padding-top:30px;"><div class="wrap about2"><div class="ph reveal"><img data-img="web-15" alt="AJYS yard and vessel care"></div><div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">About AJYS</div><h2>Marine Care Done Right &mdash; The First Time.</h2><p>AJ&rsquo;s Yacht Service handles premium vessels from center consoles to 250&prime; yachts. Every project starts with a proper assessment, never a guess, so the work protects your investment and looks like it was never touched.</p><p>From insurance claims to ceramic coatings, we handle the full scope so you keep your weekends &mdash; and your boat keeps its value.</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="#maintenance" data-route="maintenance" style="margin-top:8px;">Read More &rarr;</a></div></div></section><section style="padding:30px 0 70px;"><div class="wrap"><div class="statrow reveal"><div class="s"><div class="stat-num">15+</div><div class="stat-lbl">Years of craft</div></div><div class="s"><div class="stat-num">500+</div><div class="stat-lbl">Vessels serviced</div></div><div class="s"><div class="stat-num">7.5&times;</div><div class="stat-lbl">Insurance claim uplift</div></div><div class="s"><div class="stat-num">5.0&#9733;</div><div class="stat-lbl">Owner rated</div></div></div></div></section><section style="padding:46px 0;"><div class="bandwrap"><div class="band reveal"><div class="bg" data-img="web-12"></div><div class="ov"></div><div class="inner"><h2>Trusted By Owners Across Southwest Florida</h2><div class="loc"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg> Fort Myers, Florida</div></div><div class="count">100%</div></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="sol-head reveal"><h2>Expert Solutions For Every Surface &amp; Structure</h2><p>From gel coat to full repaints, our specialists restore finish, strength, and value &mdash; the right way, the first time.</p></div><div class="sol-grid"><div class="sol reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-4" alt="Gel Coat Mastery"></div><h3>Gel Coat Mastery</h3><p>Color-matched surface repair and oxidation removal that blends seamlessly into the original finish.</p></div><div class="sol reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-6" alt="Fiberglass Repair"></div><h3>Fiberglass Repair</h3><p>Crack, structural, and reinforcement work that brings damaged hulls back to full strength.</p></div><div class="sol reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-3" alt="Managed Care"></div><h3>Managed Care</h3><p>Scheduled detailing, inspections, and priority service that keeps your boat in peak condition.</p></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--paper);"><div class="wrap"><div class="statement reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-17" alt="Yacht interior care"></div><h2>Changing The Standard In Marine Care &mdash; With Meticulous Craftsmanship And A Genuine Eye For Detail.</h2></div></div></section><section class="dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">In Their Words</div><h2>Hear From An Owner</h2><p>Real vessels, real restoration, and a client on why they keep coming back.</p></div><div class="video-frame reveal"><video class="testimonial-video" controls preload="metadata" playsinline data-video></video></div><div class="film-cta reveal"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#reviews" data-route="reviews">Read More Reviews &rarr;</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="#contact" data-route="contact">Start Your Project</a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">What Owners Say</div><h2>Trusted, Reviewed, Recommended</h2></div><div class="rev-grid"><div class="review-card reveal"><span class="qmark">&ldquo;</span><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>Professional and top-notch workmanship. After three quotes the choice was easy &mdash; repaired on time, and you couldn&rsquo;t tell it had ever been damaged.</p><div class="r-name">Douglas Oby</div><div class="r-sub">Repair &amp; refinish</div></div><div class="review-card reveal"><span class="qmark">&ldquo;</span><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>They handle bi-weekly management on my 2024 48&prime; HCB. Professional and reliable &mdash; highly recommend for full-time maintenance.</p><div class="r-name">Alfred Reyes</div><div class="r-sub">Managed maintenance</div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="bandwrap"><div class="cta-band reveal"><div class="bg" data-img="web-14"></div><div class="ov"></div><div class="inner"><h2>Join The List Of Happy Owners</h2><form id="subForm" class="subform"><input type="email" placeholder="Your email address" aria-label="Email"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Subscribe &rarr;</button></form></div></div></div></section></div><div class="page" data-page="services"><section class="page-hero"><div class="bg" data-img="web-15"></div><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="#home" data-route="home">Home</a> / Services</div><h1>Specialist Repair &amp; Finishing Services</h1><p>Surface, structure, and finish &mdash; restored to a standard you can see up close.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Designed Solutions For You</div><h2>Core Services</h2><p>Each handled in-house by technicians who specialize in premium vessels.</p></div><div class="cards4"><a class="scard reveal" href="#contact" data-route="contact"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-4" alt="Gel Coat Repair"></div><div class="b"><h3>Gel Coat Repair</h3><p>Surface damage repair, expert color matching &amp; blending, scratch and oxidation removal.</p><span class="more">Learn more &rarr;</span></div></a><a class="scard reveal" href="#contact" data-route="contact"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-2" alt="Custom Boat Paint"></div><div class="b"><h3>Custom Boat Paint</h3><p>Paint correction &amp; refinishing, chip and fade repair, full prep &amp; seal.</p><span class="more">Learn more &rarr;</span></div></a><a class="scard reveal" href="#contact" data-route="contact"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-3" alt="Boat Detailing"></div><div class="b"><h3>Boat Detailing</h3><p>Scheduled detailing, ceramic coatings, and preventive protective care.</p><span class="more">Learn more &rarr;</span></div></a><a class="scard reveal" href="#contact" data-route="contact"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-6" alt="Fiberglass Repair"></div><div class="b"><h3>Fiberglass Repair</h3><p>Crack and structural repair, reinforcement, and finish restoration.</p><span class="more">Learn more &rarr;</span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--paper);"><div class="wrap"><div class="sol-head reveal"><h2>A Look At The Craft</h2><p>A glimpse at vessels we&rsquo;ve hauled, refinished, and returned to the water.</p></div><div class="sol-grid"><div class="sol reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-12" alt="On The Water"></div><h3>On The Water</h3><p>A premium motor yacht back in service after a full refinish.</p></div><div class="sol reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-5" alt="Protected Between Phases"></div><h3>Protected Between Phases</h3><p>Shrink-wrapped and protected between project stages, kept safe from the elements.</p></div><div class="sol reveal"><div class="ph"><img data-img="web-14" alt="Structural Repair"></div><h3>Structural Repair</h3><p>Hauled out for crack repair and reinforcement.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="dark"><div class="wrap contact-cta reveal"><h2>Not Sure What Your Boat Needs?</h2><p>Send a few details and we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly &mdash; assessment first, always.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact" data-route="contact">Get a Free Assessment &rarr;</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="tel:2396720065">Call (239) 672-0065</a></div></div></section></div><div class="page" data-page="maintenance"><section class="page-hero"><div class="bg" data-img="web-7"></div><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="#home" data-route="home">Home</a> / Maintenance</div><h1>Everything Your Boat Needs &mdash; Done Right</h1><p>Managed care for vessels from 30&prime; to 250&prime; &mdash; proactive upkeep, compliance, and one team that handles every detail.</p></div></section><section class="dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Repair &amp; Ongoing Care</div><h2>Three Ways We Keep You On The Water</h2><p>Whether a claim is involved or not, the standard never changes.</p></div><div class="m-row reveal"><div class="m-img"><img data-img="web-1" alt="Boat Repair &mdash; With Insurance"></div><div class="m-text"><h3>Boat Repair &mdash; With Insurance</h3><div class="m-tag">If insurance is involved, we handle that too.</div><ul class="anchor-list"><li>Proper documentation</li><li>Scope alignment</li><li>Claim guidance</li></ul><p class="m-note">We&rsquo;ve helped clients go from underpaid claims to full repairs done right.</p></div></div><div class="m-row reveal flip"><div class="m-img"><img data-img="web-5" alt="Boat Repair &mdash; Without Insurance"></div><div class="m-text"><h3>Boat Repair &mdash; Without Insurance</h3><div class="m-tag">Experienced boat repairs.</div><ul class="anchor-list"><li>Fiberglass repair</li><li>Gel coat repair</li><li>Full repainting